        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔍 Two similar pictures? Only at first glance! 🏆</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot the differences faster than your opponent and prove who’s the real observation master. You'll face levels of varying difficulty with 5–10 differences, vibrant images, and easy zoom controls. Stuck? Use a hint - but remember, your opponent won’t wait!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 No Time Limits, Just Pure Challenge!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no timer in Differences Online, but that doesn’t mean you can relax. Each round is a duel of perception, where the first to find all the differences wins. Play online against real players, prove your observation skills, and climb the leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462600/extras/14fe10389de5a0a0adba7f007384894c.poster.avif?t=1766157678\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462600/extras/14fe10389de5a0a0adba7f007384894c.webm?t=1766157678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462600/extras/14fe10389de5a0a0adba7f007384894c.mp4?t=1766157678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🗺️ Discover New Locations!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you’ll unlock new themed picture sets. Explore different game settings, enjoy beautifully crafted scenes, and sharpen your skills with every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462600/extras/ff23058bd8d2fc00a0c518c09727b3a2.poster.avif?t=1766157678\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://sha